Patricia is a chess program written by Adam Kulju. It uses
a pair of NNEU neural networks for evaluation, one of them was
trained with specially selected "aggressive positions".

Patricia needs to be used with a UCI front-end, such as Xboard
LucasChess, or CuteChess. Patricia can be tuned to play at
lower skill levels, from ELO 500 to 3000. It can use Syzygy
tablebases for endgame, see
https://chess.massimilianogoi.com/download/tablebases/ for
practical information.
